\tag{fdip}
\title{Finite fields with a fixed boundary}
\date{2026-11-09}

\p{A [massive graph field](fdip-00GJ) records both internal bonds and
boundary data in its energy. On a square, setting exterior values to
zero leaves an energy contribution at every missing neighbor. Which
positive operator and quartic weight retain those contributions as the
mesh shrinks?}

